{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32859","headline":"府试风雨闻鸡 · 李频","name":"府试风雨闻鸡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不爲风雨变，鸡德一何贞。\n在暗长先觉，临晨即自鸣。\n阴霾方见信，顷刻讵移声。\n向晦如相警，知时似独清。\n萧萧和断漏，喔喔报重城。\n欲识诗人兴，中含君子情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}